The choice of a footwear depends on the type of hazard. As with all footwear, additional requirements
may exist (e.g. penetration resistance or electrical resistance including ESD. These footwear are then
marked accordingly. The testing methods are specified in ISO 20344/IS15298(Part1).
OPTION :
Conductive; ESD; EH
Penetration Resistant Sole
Water Resistant Upper
